msgstr "WP-Cron: programador interno de tareas periódicas de WordPress."

#: admin/DashboardData.php:354
msgid "Loopback: whether WordPress can communicate with itself; required by WP-Cron and Site Health."
msgstr "Loopback: si WordPress puede comunicarse consigo mismo, requisito de WP-Cron y Site Health."

